          "message": {
            "text": ".github/workflows/ai-review.yml runs claude-cli, which external:anyone can start on issue_comment; the agent job holds secrets and reaches 1 secrets scope. Restrict who can start it: the agent has no actor check of its own, so move it off issue_comment or pull_request_target, check the actor's repository permission in a step before the agent runs, or require approval for outside contributors (an environment with required reviewers)."
          },
